                                        <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-1-content-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-1-content-1">
                                            What do I need to rent a car?
                                        </button>
                                      </h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="collapse" id="accordion-tab-1-content-1" aria-labelledby="accordion-tab-1-heading-1" data-parent="#accordion-tab-1">
                                      <div class="faq-body">
                                        <p>
                                            You must have the following documents with you in order to rent a car. 
                                        
                                            A valid passport.
                                            A valid international driving licence.
                                            A valid temporary local (Sri Lankan) driving licence.
                                            Valid working credit card.
                                        </p>
                                      </div>
                                    </div>
                                  </div>
                                  
                                <div class="card">
                                    <div class="card-header" id="accordion-tab-1-heading-2">
                                        <h5>
                                            <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-1-content-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-1-content-2">What type of driver\'s license do I need to drive in Sri Lanka?</button>
                                        </h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="collapse" id="accordion-tab-1-content-2" aria-labelledby="accordion-tab-1-heading-2" data-parent="#accordion-tab-1">
                                        <div class="faq-body">
                                            <p>
                                                You’ll need a valid International Driving Permit issued by a competent government institution that conforms to the format specified by the Geneva Convention on Road Traffic 1949.
                                                You’ll also need to obtain a Temporary Sri Lanka Driving Permit (TDL).
                                                    Now it is COMPULSORY to obtain a TDL for every foreigner to drive a vehicle in Sri Lanka.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card">
                                    <div class="card-header" id="accordion-tab-1-heading-3">
                                        <h5>
                                            <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-1-content-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-1-content-3">How can I obtain a temporary driving license (TDL) in Sri Lanka?</button>
                                        </h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="collapse" id="accordion-tab-1-content-3" aria-labelledby="accordion-tab-1-heading-3" data-parent="#accordion-tab-1">
                                        <div class="faq-body">
                                            <p>
                                                You’ll have two options.
                                            
                                                You can obtain it yourself when you are in Sri Lanka. (It can not be done online & your only option will be by visiting the Sri Lanka Motor Trafic Department)
                                                We can obtain it on behalf of you. You just need to mention that you need a TDL when you request a quote.
                                            </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card">
                                    <div class="card-header" id="accordion-tab-1-heading-4">
                                        <h5>
                                            <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-1-content-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-1-content-4">Can elderly people also rent cars?</button>
                                        </h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="collapse" id="accordion-tab-1-content-4" aria-labelledby="accordion-tab-1-heading-4" data-parent="#accordion-tab-1">
                                        <div class="faq-body">
                                            <p>Yes. No age restrictions are in place. Anybody with a valid driver’s license can rent a vehicle.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tab-pane" id="tab2" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab2">
                            <div class="accordion" id="accordion-tab-2">
                                <div class="card">
                                    <div class="card-header" id="accordion-tab-2-heading-1">
                                        <h5>
                                            <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-2-content-1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-2-content-1">What is included in the rental price, and are there any additional fees?</button>
                                        </h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="collapse " id="accordion-tab-2-content-1" aria-labelledby="accordion-tab-2-heading-1" data-parent="#accordion-tab-2">
                                        <div class="faq-body">
                                            <p style="text-align: justify;">
                                                The basic rental price typically covers the vehicle and standard insurance. 
                                                However, there are several additional optional services and fees that customers may choose based on their needs. These may include:
                                            </p>
                                            <ul style="padding-left: 20px;">
                                                <li>Unlimited mileage or mileage restrictions</li>
                                                <li>Additional driver fees</li>
                                                <li>Baby seat rental</li>
                                                <li>Additional navigation systems</li>
                                                <li>Fuel charges (full-to-full or prepaid fuel options)</li>
                                                <li>Optional insurance upgrades</li>
                                            </ul>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card">
                                    <div class="card-header" id="accordion-tab-2-heading-2">
                                        <h5>
                                            <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-2-content-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-2-content-2">Can I drop off the car at a different location from where I picked it up?</button>
                                        </h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="collapse" id="accordion-tab-2-content-2" aria-labelledby="accordion-tab-2-heading-2" data-parent="#accordion-tab-2">
                                        <div class="faq-body">
                                            <p style="text-align: justify;">One-way rentals are possible but typically incur an additional fee. Our rental staff will conduct a thorough vehicle inspection at the collection point to ensure the condition of the vehicle before finalizing the rental agreement.</p>
                                        
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card">
