                                            <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-2-content-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-2-content-3">What happens if I need to cancel my reservation?</button>
                                        </h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="collapse" id="accordion-tab-2-content-3" aria-labelledby="accordion-tab-2-heading-3" data-parent="#accordion-tab-2">
                                        <div class="faq-body">
                                            <p style="text-align: justify;">Cancellation policies vary depending on the type of reservation and how close it is to the pickup date. </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card">
                                    <div class="card-header" id="accordion-tab-2-heading-4">
                                        <h5>
                                            <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-2-content-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-2-content-4">Can I modify my existing reservation?</button>
                                        </h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="collapse" id="accordion-tab-2-content-4" aria-labelledby="accordion-tab-2-heading-4" data-parent="#accordion-tab-2">
                                        <div class="faq-body">
                                            <p style="text-align: justify;">Reservation modifications are possible, preferably with at least 24 hours\' notice. Changes can even be made at the collection point, subject to vehicle availability. </p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="card">
                                    <div class="card-header" id="accordion-tab-2-heading-5">
                                        <h5>
                                            <button class="btn btn-link" type="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#accordion-tab-2-content-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-tab-2-content-4">How much will it cost to modify a reservation?</button>
                                        </h5>
                                    </div>
